ull power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The greener the world, the stronger you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/6f95ef693ebdd129b8484e13eeecb7ee.poster.avif?t=1768586109\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/6f95ef693ebdd129b8484e13eeecb7ee.webm?t=1768586109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/6f95ef693ebdd129b8484e13eeecb7ee.mp4?t=1768586109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FIGHT FOR YOUR FUTURE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The wasteland belongs to no one—until you take it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face mutants and rogue machines in deadly encounters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raid enemy camps for resources. Defend your own with everything you’ve got.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arm your Ecopunks with one-shot pistols, heavy shotguns, armor—and whatever else you can craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/f60b78493a369adf6083d50f16192406.poster.avif?t=1768586109\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/f60b78493a369adf6083d50f16192406.webm?t=1768586109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/f60b78493a369adf6083d50f16192406.mp4?t=1768586109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RESEARCH &amp; EVOLVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brains win wars too. Unlock new tech, craft better weapons, and make your colony unbreakable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/f2de0350ad83c9eae4b5adcf0d484242.poster.avif?t=1768586109\" width=532 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/f2de0350ad83c9eae4b5adcf0d484242.webm?t=1768586109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033610/extras/f2de0350ad83c9eae4b5adcf0d484242.mp4?t=1768586109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
